# Generated exports from the Kassensystem "Datensicherung"/export feature (CSV/Excel/PDF sales
# exports and DB backups) default to a filename like kassensystem-verkaeufe-YYYY-MM-DD.* or
# kassensystem-sicherung-YYYY-MM-DD.db and can end up saved at the repo root if the save dialog's
# working directory isn't changed - these are user data, never meant to be version controlled.
/kassensystem-verkaeufe-*.csv
/kassensystem-verkaeufe-*.xlsx
/kassensystem-verkaeufe-*.pdf
/kassensystem-sicherung-*.db
